│ patch_description        │ The examples motivate using archive quality and population spread together. This proposal │
│                          │ replaces target-width smoothing with a persistent evidence controller: archive            │
│                          │ improvement and offspring competitiveness support expansion, while population damage      │
│                          │ supports contraction. Accumulated evidence provides hysteresis, and weak, narrow          │
│                          │ populations receive exploration pressure. Quality-dependent bounds limit mutation width   │
│                          │ as performance improves. It uses no switch schedule; performance remains to be evaluated. │
