│ patch_description        │ Track progress primarily through the re-scored archive: whole-population mean can fall    │
│                          │ simply because mutations broaden. Accumulate stagnation only when performance changes     │
│                          │ little, so abrupt losses do not immediately count as plateaus. Make the exploration boost │
│                          │ depend cubically on persistent stagnation and remaining archive improvement,              │
│                          │ concentrating broader mutations on sustained, low-diversity stalls. Faster contraction    │
│                          │ toward the target should reduce wasted generations after productive policies emerge. This │
│                          │ is an untested feedback-based proposal.                                                   │
